HeLLo is not purely alphabetic
HeLLo#WorLD is not purely alphabetic
```

The `ctype_alpha` function is case-insensitive, meaning that it recognizes both uppercase and lowercase letters as alphabetic characters. Therefore, the script works correctly regardless of the letter case.

